SUMMARY:Great Southeast Pollinator Census (Wilmington)
DESCRIPTION:Come learn how to count pollinators at Rise Up Community Farm! Contributing to the census helps natural resource professionals across the southeast track pollinator trends and gives us 15 minutes of garden meditation with wildlife. No experience needed; all ages welcome! Children must be accompanied by an adult. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/great-southeast-pollinator-census-wilmington/
CATEGORIES:Featured
