SUMMARY:Pollinator Field Day (Raleigh)
DESCRIPTION:Stop by Pollinator Field Day at the North Carolina State Farmers Market for tips about gardening\, presentations about gardening for wildlife (no matter what size your yard is!)\, pollinator activities and crafts for kids\, free plant giveaways\, community partner tables\, and more! While you’re there\, participate in the Great Southeast Pollinator Census to help us better understand how are native pollinators are doing. Buzz on over!
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/pollinator-field-day-raleigh/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/NCPCA-Pollinator-Field-Day-Poster-2026.png
