SUMMARY:Wildlife Trivia Night (Holly Springs)
DESCRIPTION:Calling all wildlife enthusiasts! Wildlife Trivia Night is officially back by popular demand. Join NCWF South Wake Conservationists Chapter at Black Dog Bottle Shop in Holly Springs and test your knowledge of incredible animals and more at this fun community event. Prepare for an evening of fun and challenging questions that will put your wildlife smarts to the test! \nThis is a family-friendly event! Gather your friends and family\, enjoy Black Dog Bottle Shop’s fantastic selection of beverages\, and compete for bragging rights and prizes! There are also several great restaurants in the same shopping center if you’d like to grab takeout to enjoy during the event. \nMark your calendars\, build your team\, and we’ll see you there! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/wildlife-trivia-night-holly-springs/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
