DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Tri-County Conservationists Chapter and the New Hope Bird Alliance for a guided bird walk at Brumley South. We will meander through the park\, pointing out the many birds in the air\, on the ground\, or in their nests as we walk. This is a family-friendly event for all ages! \nREGISTER HERE
