DESCRIPTION:Explore the ecology of Buffalo Creek Nature Preserve with a naturalist. We will look for different flowers and identify plants on this almost 2 mile walk. Please dress for the weather\, wear comfortable shoes\, and be prepared to walk on uneven terrain. Adult participation required if under 18. \nREGISTER HERE
