SUMMARY:Great Southeast Pollinator Census (New London)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Uwharrie Wildlife Stewards Chapter and the NC Native Plant Society for the Great Southeast Pollinator Census\, a fun community science project. Participants will learn about pollinators\, including tips for identification and methods to create pollinator habitat at home. Instructions and materials will be provided for participants to collect data for the Great Southeast Pollinator Census. Our observations will be submitted online to generate useful data about our pollinator populations that contribute to research and conservation. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/great-southeast-pollinator-census-new-london/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/1783441425509.jpg
