SUMMARY:Community Snorkel Adventure in the Watauga River (Sugar Grove)
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars and get underwater with us this August! As we say goodbye to Summer\, join MountainTrue alongside NCWF High Country Wild for a guided Watauga River snorkel near Sugar Grove\, NC! Get up close + personal with many native fish species (like our favorite tangerine darter) and use view buckets to see under the water’s surface to observe your favorite local river critters. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/community-snorkel-adventure/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
